OL,3,GNEWSAStormont 'broke own policies' over
OL,4,Aelectric car chargers for MLAs
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Assumptions and flaws in process" led
OL,7,Fto politicians being able to charge
OL,8,Ftheir electric vehicles (EVs) for free
OL,9,Fat the Northern Ireland Assembly, an
OL,10,Finternal review has found.
OL,12,FIt was commissioned after a BBC News NI
OL,13,Finvestigation revealed that some
OL,14,Fassembly members (MLAs) were
OL,15,Fbenefitting from the chargers at
OL,16,FParliament Buildings while also
OL,17,Fclaiming travel expenses - all within
OL,18,Fexisting rules.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
