OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStormont 'broke own policies' over
OL,4,Aelectric car chargers for MLAs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charging points have been suspended
OL,7,Fsince June after Stormont parties
OL,8,Ftasked officials with introducing a
OL,9,Fpayment system following a public
OL,10,Fbacklash.
OL,12,FThe report found that the assembly had
OL,13,Fbreached its own policies in its
OL,14,Fhandling of the free chargers - but any
OL,15,Factions taken were "not in bad faith".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
